# Its own separate git repo (its own remotes/history) — must never be
# git-added from here, or it becomes a broken gitlink instead of real
# content. POS itself now lives in src/pos/, bundled into this app; this
# directory (renamed from pos_standalone - v1/) is dormant. Leading slash
# anchors this to the repo root only — without it, "pos/" would also match
# (and wrongly hide) the real, tracked src/pos/.
/pos/

